---
description: All code identifiers, routes, and variables must be in English
alwaysApply: true
---

# English-only code

Always use English for anything in the codebase:

- Variable, function, class, type, and file names
- API routes and URL paths
- Database fields, Prisma models, and migration names
- Environment variables and config keys
- Comments and inline documentation in code

Portuguese is allowed only in user-facing copy (UI strings, emails, marketing) via i18n/message files — never in code identifiers or routes.

Examples:

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const saldoCreditos = await getCreditos(empresaId);
router.get('/dashboard/creditos', ...);

// ✅ GOOD
const creditBalance = await getCredits(companyId);
router.get('/dashboard/credits', ...);
```
